      <span class="summit-tag">What Awaits</span>
      <h2 style="font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem);font-weight:400;margin:0;letter-spacing:-0.02em;">Summit Tracks</h2>
    </div>
    <p style="font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.35);max-width:320px;text-align:right;line-height:1.6;">Six high-impact formats designed for school leaders who want to build, not just listen.</p>
