      ["02","Innovation Showcase","Peer learning","Fast-paced case studies from schools that have already made the leap. Real results, real schools."],
      ["03","School Shark Tank","Pitch competition","Pitch your idea to education investors and veteran school operators. Winners get mentorship and maximum visibility."],
      ["04","AI Hackathon","Build in 24 hrs","Teams compete to build working AI tools for real school problems — judged by tech and education leaders."],
      ["05","Power Networking","500+ leaders","Structured sessions ensure every connection is meaningful. No random mingling. Curated introductions."],
      ["06","Keynotes & Clinics","Master classes","Curated talks from India's top education minds followed by open-format problem-solving clinics."]
